          "flag_resolutions": []
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P2",
          "source_hash": "sha256:f9c09452413949dafbe0650d39a291b14e52adea80e9c7e016f10c44accaa34f",
          "target_text": "Inhloso: Le nqubo ichaza ukuthi amaqembu asemkhakheni awaqoqa futhi awarekhoda kanjani amasampula amanzi okuphuza ukuze imiphumela ithembeke futhi ilandeleke endaweni efanele.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:1e8bc39302e060a2860f3ad01bf4c93e6d0f5fe11585634a4854498656ff38f8",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:42:27+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:05+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": []
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P3",
          "source_hash": "sha256:5fa9b423f038d374b2b7545169516f31213c3b78510a800e274200de427854d8",
          "target_text": "Ububanzi: Isebenza kumasampula avamile aqoqwa emadamu, ezindaweni zokukhipha amanzi okwelashwa, nasempompini zomphakathi. Le nqubo ayihlanganisi ukuvuza kwamakhemikhali okuphuthumayo noma ukulinganisa amathuluzi aselabhorethri.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:e99cda96ec24d4b6bfe19bede9b5b4301c925beef99774b5ddfb5905c8282239",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P3",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "The term 'treatment outlets' is translated descriptively; confirm if a standard isiZulu term exists in municipal water operations."
            }
          ],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:42:27+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:05+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P4",
          "source_hash": "sha256:a272e53fc39b49b3ebdf0382af87ccee81191dab762cc09c16bee87a30300d1a",
          "target_text": "Izemfanelo: Umholi weqembu uhlola ukuthi uchwepheshe ngamunye une-PBT, amabhodlela amasampula ahlanzekile, nemitha elinganisiwe. Ochwepheshe banomthwalo wemfanelo wokuqedela Ifomu Lokulandelelwa Kokutholakala Kwezinto (QMS-07) nokubika izimo ezingaphephile.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:18da59e6903c05ee591d820b7ab4bab964180738915f364d1fc4832a54d1708d",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P4",
              "severity": "high",
              "issue": "The acronym 'PBT' is not expanded in the source and its meaning is unclear; a human reviewer must confirm the intended term (e.g., personal protective equipment) and its isiZulu equivalent."
            },
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P4",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "The term 'Chain of Custody Form' is translated descriptively; confirm if a standard isiZulu term is used by the municipality."
            }
          ],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:42:27+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:05+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "index": 1,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P5",
          "source_hash": "sha256:e6d80845288e1038283fce35bcef4338071e104294483476ba4b19b9183e6923",
          "target_text": "Inqubo: Ngaphambi kokuqoqa isampula, vumela impompi igijime imizuzu emi-2. Geza iphrobu ngamanzi ahlanzekile, kodwa ungagezi ibhodlela elinyumba elingenawo amagciwane. Bhala i-pH nokufiphala (turbidity) nge-NTU endaweni. Amasampula kufanele abekwe esiqandisini phakathi kuka-2 no-8 degrees Celsius.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:4ea8eae6ae1547d5ef185656e8f3a7a4a8f9d969167855329e49a86c644f6dce",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P5",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "The term 'probe' is transliterated as 'iphrobu'; confirm if a more standard term is used in the field."
            }
          ],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:42:27+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:05+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P6",
          "source_hash": "sha256:d5cffac5f5de7b263acb17219dfd1cc55aa9670249a668392aef211438f236eb",
          "target_text": "Ukurekhoda idatha: Bhala ikhodi yendawo, usuku, isikhathi, nama-inishiyali zomuntu othatha isampula kubhodlela naku-QMS-07. Ukulungisa amaphutha kufanele kwenziwe ngomugqa owodwa phezu kwephutha; ukusebenzisa uketshezi lokulungisa akukuvunyelwe. Isizathu sanoma yikuphi ukungafundi okungekho kufanele sishiwo.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:1b53e0f10fb0932f70eac122d5b11a9c06498835296eb5beca7d8403feb8af0f",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P6",
