        {
          "unit_id": "P7",
          "source_hash": "sha256:2bf94e6373f0c398a51046f440a6dc53f7439500db2606458082030d89010c6c",
          "target_text": "Ukuphakamisa udaba: Uma i-pH ingaphansi kuka-6.5 noma ingaphezu kuka-9.5, noma ukufiphala kuphakeme kuno-1 NTU, shayela umholi weqembu ngokushesha. Ungatsheli umphakathi ukuthi amanzi aphephile noma awaphephile kuze kube yilapho isikhulu esigunyaziwe sibuyekeze umphumela.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:f48781c7aea1989bbab85e0cdde109aeb5f19ba2590d942aa87075512b1032a9",
