    "Sesotho": {
      "language": "Sesotho",
      "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
      "source_version": "1.0.0",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
      "units": [
        {
          "unit_id": "P1",
          "source_hash": "sha256:ae4ca5941c535365a8da742dd2bbdc26562a66d118a3091093e548920feef0fe",
          "target_text": "Mokhoa oa ho Lekola Boleng ba Metsi a Sechaba",
          "target_hash": "sha256:bf12d0c5ea012fea704081604245256d89cd914da61e97f97a5239ab37cbcd9d",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:40:48+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": []
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P2",
          "source_hash": "sha256:f9c09452413949dafbe0650d39a291b14e52adea80e9c7e016f10c44accaa34f",
          "target_text": "Morero: Mokhoa ona o hlalosa hore na lihlopha tsa masimong li bokella le ho ngola mehlala ea metsi a nooang joang e le hore liphetho li t\u0161epahale le ho lateloa ho ea sebakeng se nepahetseng.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:5e5c60fdbe9d0bddc0115ba4c005b01959dca1ffd03eed70484f3d95295d659e",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:40:48+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": []
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P3",
          "source_hash": "sha256:5fa9b423f038d374b2b7545169516f31213c3b78510a800e274200de427854d8",
          "target_text": "Sebaka sa t\u0161ebeliso: Se sebetsa ho mehlala e tloaelehileng e bokelloang matamong, libakeng tsa phekolo ea metsi, le lipompong tsa sechaba. Mokhoa ona ha o akaretse ho qhalana ha lik'hemik'hale tsa t\u0161ohanyetso kapa ho lekanya lisebelisoa tsa laboratori.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:0d8b1880f07881e5ba46c69d4854bc560d6075811bdca8b8e9bcd209d958f552",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:40:48+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": []
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P4",
          "source_hash": "sha256:a272e53fc39b49b3ebdf0382af87ccee81191dab762cc09c16bee87a30300d1a",
          "target_text": "Boikarabelo: Moetapele oa sehlopha o hlahloba hore setekheniki se seng le se seng se na le PBT, libotlolo tse hloekileng tsa mehlala, le metha e lekantsoeng. Lithekheniki li ikarabella ho tlatsa Foromo ea Chain of Custody QMS-07 le ho tlaleha maemo a sa bolokehang.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:81210c0df45d2396b9ba234074810260cebfa4d9c4cf8339e753d1cd53384211",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P4",
              "severity": "high",
              "issue": "PBT is not expanded; technicians may not know what it stands for. Consider adding a definition or using a local term for personal protective equipment."
            }
          ],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:40:48+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "resolution": "corrected",
              "note": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P5",
          "source_hash": "sha256:e6d80845288e1038283fce35bcef4338071e104294483476ba4b19b9183e6923",
          "target_text": "Mokhoa: Pele o bokella sampole, lumella pompo hore e phalle metsi ka metsotso e 2. Hlatsoa probe ka metsi a hloekileng, empa u se ke ua hlatsoa botlolo e sa t\u0161oaetsoang ea likokoana-hloko. Ngola pH le turbidity ka NTU sebakeng seo. Mehlala e tlameha ho behoa ka har'a sehatsetsi pakeng tsa 2 le 8 degrees Celsius.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:ea288dcdad38cab48aaf7e3d37b0d9e4b4e5ce5da170775235ffaf23164a5c05",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P5",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "The term 'probe' is retained in English; ensure technicians understand it refers to the sensor of the meter."
            },
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P5",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "The phrase 'degrees Celsius' is kept in English; consider using 'likhato tsa Celsius' for clarity."
            }
          ],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:40:48+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "index": 1,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P6",
          "source_hash": "sha256:d5cffac5f5de7b263acb17219dfd1cc55aa9670249a668392aef211438f236eb",
          "target_text": "Ho ngola data: Ngola khoutu ea sebaka, letsatsi, nako, le litlhaku tsa motho ea nkang sampole botlolong le ho QMS-07. Litokiso li tlameha ho etsoa ka mola o le mong ho t\u0161ela phoso; ha ho lumelloe ho sebelisa mokelikeli oa ho lokisa. Lebaka la ho se baloe ho itseng le tlameha ho boleloa.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:21d8b800831f3279c11755f1695c754cf6b4af7aa6596799834e97fcb1d42fe5",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:40:48+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": []
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P7",
          "source_hash": "sha256:2bf94e6373f0c398a51046f440a6dc53f7439500db2606458082030d89010c6c",
          "target_text": "Ho nyolla taba: Haeba pH e ka tlase ho 6.5 kapa e kaholimo ho 9.5, kapa turbidity e phahame ho feta 1 NTU, letsetsa moetapele oa sehlopha hang-hang. U se ke ua bolella sechaba hore metsi a bolokehile kapa ha a bolokeha ho fihlela ofisiri e lumelletsoeng e hlahlobile sephetho.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:cde0434c4199d01f9f31d9d349d819574f38a291cfd8485ae27571ac3d32da56",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
