          "target_text": "Mokgwa wa go Lekola Boleng jwa Metsi a Set\u0161haba",
          "target_hash": "sha256:3bad983d00aabf755a86872e0c1eedbb90d59cd7ec5ff19f6a3f5d1f823c258d",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:41:38+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": []
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P2",
          "source_hash": "sha256:f9c09452413949dafbe0650d39a291b14e52adea80e9c7e016f10c44accaa34f",
          "target_text": "Maikaelelo: Mokgwa o o tlhalosa gore ditlhopha tsa kwa ntle di kgobokanya le go kwala disampole tsa metsi a go nwa jang gore dipholo di nne tse di tshephegang le tse di ka latelwang kwa lefelong le le siameng.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:d26854fa8c09390587b99954f453112486fdea9293201c0e8196de881e76380b",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:41:38+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": []
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P3",
          "source_hash": "sha256:5fa9b423f038d374b2b7545169516f31213c3b78510a800e274200de427854d8",
          "target_text": "Kakaretso: O dira ka disampole tsa tlwaelo tse di tserweng mo matamong, mo mafelong a go alafa metsi, le mo dipompong tsa set\u0161haba. Mokgwa o ga o akaretse tshetleho ya dikhemikale tsa tshoganetso kgotsa go lekanyetsa didirisiwa tsa kwa laboratoring.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:f0b7b0e63fd5d60e69d0fe7e8a4baabd1da7596af5b5465010b54a72a88d52c6",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:41:38+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": []
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P4",
          "source_hash": "sha256:a272e53fc39b49b3ebdf0382af87ccee81191dab762cc09c16bee87a30300d1a",
          "target_text": "Maikarabelo: Moeteledipele wa setlhopha o tlhatlhoba gore motekheniki mongwe le mongwe o na le PBT, dibotlelana tsa disampole tse di phepa, le selekanyetsi se se lekanyeditsweng. Batekheniki ba na le maikarabelo a go tlatsa Foromo ya QMS-07 ya Chain of Custody le go bega maemo a a sa bolokehang.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:3d9b317afeae2309f033700f9a23f611f71a218e7a0d715be1ea5d2b40a9a24b",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P4",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "The term 'Chain of Custody' is a legal/administrative concept; ensure the translation conveys the formal tracking process. Consider adding a brief explanation if needed."
            }
          ],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:41:38+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P5",
          "source_hash": "sha256:e6d80845288e1038283fce35bcef4338071e104294483476ba4b19b9183e6923",
          "target_text": "Mokgwa: Pele o tsaya sampole, letla pompo e elele ka metsotso e 2. Tlhatswa probe ka metsi a a phepa, mme o se ka wa tlhatswa botlhelo jo bo sa bolaeng jwa microbiological. Kwala pH le turbidity ka NTU kwa lefelong. Disampole di tshwanetse go bewa mo setsidifatsing magareng ga 2 le 8 degrees Celsius.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:c0342f5bec158e2fcbdd559dc5eced6760c9d245fe874a9ffd1ad3cac0b29552",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P5",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "Technical terms 'probe', 'microbiological', 'turbidity', and 'degrees Celsius' are retained in English; verify that this is acceptable for the target audience or if local equivalents exist."
            }
          ],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:41:38+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P6",
          "source_hash": "sha256:d5cffac5f5de7b263acb17219dfd1cc55aa9670249a668392aef211438f236eb",
          "target_text": "Go kwala datha: Kwala khoutu ya lefelo, letlha, nako, le dit\u0161hupiso tsa motlhatlheledi mo botlhelong le mo QMS-07. Diphoso di tshwanetse go suthisiwa ka mola o le mongwe go ralala phoso; ga go letlelelwe go dirisa setlhotlho sa go phimola. Lebaka la go tlhoka go bala lepe le tshwanetse go tlhalosiwa.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:202b8f264268d704e62edc908a1e5804e24b9b63c5ba9ef8a8115e2d915a7e81",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P6",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "The translation of 'sampler initials' as 'dit\u0161hupiso tsa motlhatlheledi' may not be precise; consider 'dit\u0161hupiso tsa yo o tsayang sampole' for clarity."
            },
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P6",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "The term 'correction fluid' is translated as 'setlhotlho sa go phimola' (eraser fluid); verify that this is the common term in Setswana for correction fluid."
            }
          ],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:41:38+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
          "flag_resolutions": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "index": 1,
              "resolution": "accepted_as_is",
              "note": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "unit_id": "P7",
          "source_hash": "sha256:2bf94e6373f0c398a51046f440a6dc53f7439500db2606458082030d89010c6c",
          "target_text": "Go oket\u0161a: Fa pH e le kwa tlase ga 6.5 kgotsa e feta 9.5, kgotsa turbidity e feta 1 NTU, bitsa moeteledipele wa setlhopha ka bonako. O se ka wa bolelela set\u0161haba gore metsi a bolokehile kgotsa ga a bolokeha go fitlha lekgetho le le letleletsweng le lekotse dipholo.",
          "target_hash": "sha256:9601e45e6b6c5e8e0ef73c234ece27bbc955467071f84235a796c55d1378ed72",
          "status": "human_approved_crystallized",
          "provider": "nvidia_nim",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash-0731",
          "critic_changed": false,
          "qa_flags": [
            {
              "paragraph_id": "P7",
              "severity": "medium",
              "issue": "The translation of 'authorised official' as 'lekgetho le le letleletsweng' may be ambiguous; consider 'modiri yo o letleletsweng' or 'ofisiri e e letleletsweng' for clarity."
            }
          ],
          "reviewer": "Byron Bunt",
          "approved_at": "2026-08-09T11:41:38+00:00",
          "updated_at": "2026-08-09T11:38:06+00:00",
